{"task_id": "Mbpp/56", "solution": "def check(number: int) -> bool:\n    \"\"\"\n    Determines if a given number is one less than twice its reverse.\n    \"\"\"\n    def _calculate_reverse(n: int) -> int:\n        \"\"\"\n        Calculates the reverse of a given integer.\n        \"\"\"\n        return int(str(n)[::-1])\n\n    reversed_number = _calculate_reverse(number)\n    return number == (2 * reversed_number) - 1"}
{"task_id": "Mbpp/20", "solution": "def is_woodall(num: int) -> bool:\n    \"\"\"Checks if the given number is a Woodall number (n * 2^n - 1).\"\"\"\n    if num < 1:  # Woodall numbers are positive\n        return False\n\n    n = 1\n    while True:\n        woodall_candidate = n * (2 ** n) - 1\n        if woodall_candidate == num:\n            return True\n        elif woodall_candidate > num:\n            return False\n        n += 1"}
