{"task_id": "Mbpp/61", "solution": "def count_Substrings(input_string: str) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Counts the number of substrings where the sum of digits equals their length.\n    It iterates through all possible substrings to check this condition.\n    \"\"\"\n    total_count = 0\n    n = len(input_string)\n\n    for i in range(n):\n        current_sum = 0\n        for j in range(i, n):\n            current_sum += int(input_string[j])\n            substring_length = j - i + 1\n            if current_sum == substring_length:\n                total_count += 1\n    return total_count"}
