{"task_id": "Mbpp/126", "solution": "import builtins\ndef _get_divisors(n: int) -> set[int]:\n    \"\"\"\n    Helper function to find all positive divisors of a given integer.\n    \"\"\"\n    if n <= 0:\n        return set()\n    divs = set()\n    for i in range(1, int(n**0.5) + 1):\n        if n % i == 0:\n            divs.add(i)\n            divs.add(n // i)\n    return divs\ndef sum(num1: int, num2: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the sum of common divisors for two given integers.\n    \"\"\"\n    divisors1 = _get_divisors(num1)\n    divisors2 = _get_divisors(num2)\n\n    common_divs = divisors1.intersection(divisors2)\n\n    return builtins.sum(common_divs)"}
