{"task_id": "Mbpp/137", "solution": "def zero_count(array_of_integers: list[int]) -> float:\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the ratio of zeroes to non-zeroes in an array of integers.\n    Handles edge cases for empty arrays or arrays containing only zeroes.\n    \"\"\"\n    zero_count = 0\n    non_zero_count = 0\n\n    for element in array_of_integers:\n        if element == 0:\n            zero_count += 1\n        else:\n            non_zero_count += 1\n\n    if non_zero_count == 0:\n        if zero_count == 0:  # Empty array\n            return float('nan')\n        else:  # Array contains only zeroes\n            return float('inf')\n    else:\n        return float(zero_count) / non_zero_count"}
