{"task_id": "Mbpp/224", "solution": "def count_Set_Bits(number: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Counts the number of set bits (1s) in the binary representation of a given integer.\n    This implementation uses Brian Kernighan's algorithm.\n    \"\"\"\n    count = 0\n    while number > 0:\n        number &= (number - 1)\n        count += 1\n    return count"}
