{"task_id": "Mbpp/272", "solution": "def rear_extract(list_of_tuples: list[tuple]) -> list[any]:\n    \"\"\"\n    Extracts the last element from each tuple in a list of tuples.\n    Raises TypeError or ValueError for invalid inputs as per design.\n    \"\"\"\n    if not isinstance(list_of_tuples, list):\n        raise TypeError(\"Input must be a list.\")\n\n    result_list = []\n    for item in list_of_tuples:\n        if not isinstance(item, tuple):\n            raise TypeError(\"All elements in the input list must be tuples.\")\n        if len(item) == 0:\n            raise ValueError(\"Tuples in the input list cannot be empty.\")\n        result_list.append(item[-1])\n    return result_list"}
