{"task_id": "Mbpp/286", "solution": "def max_sub_array_sum_repeated(array: list[int], length: int, k: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the largest sum of a contiguous subarray in a conceptually repeated array.\n    \"\"\"\n    def _kadane(arr: list[int]) -> int:\n        \"\"\"Calculates the largest sum of a contiguous subarray in a single given non-empty array.\"\"\"\n        max_so_far = arr[0]\n        current_max = arr[0]\n        for i in range(1, len(arr)):\n            current_max = max(arr[i], current_max + arr[i])\n            max_so_far = max(max_so_far, current_max)\n        return max_so_far\n\n    if length == 0:\n        return 0\n\n    max_sum_single_pass = _kadane(array)\n\n    if k == 1:\n        return max_sum_single_pass\n\n    total_sum = sum(array)\n\n    current_prefix_sum = 0\n    max_prefix_sum = -float('inf')\n    for x in array:\n        current_prefix_sum += x\n        max_prefix_sum = max(max_prefix_sum, current_prefix_sum)\n\n    current_suffix_sum = 0\n    max_suffix_sum = -float('inf')\n    for x in reversed(array):\n        current_suffix_sum += x\n        max_suffix_sum = max(max_suffix_sum, current_suffix_sum)\n\n    overall_max = max_sum_single_pass\n\n    if total_sum > 0:\n        # If total sum is positive, consider spanning across multiple blocks with full blocks in between\n        overall_max = max(overall_max, max_prefix_sum + max_suffix_sum + max(0, (k - 2) * total_sum))\n    else:\n        # If total sum is non-positive, the max subarray can at most span two original arrays\n        max_sum_two_passes = _kadane(array + array)\n        overall_max = max(overall_max, max_sum_two_passes)\n    \n    return overall_max"}
