{"task_id": "Mbpp/389", "solution": "def find_lucas(n: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Calculates the n'th Lucas number based on its mathematical definition.\"\"\"\n    if n == 0:\n        return 2\n    elif n == 1:\n        return 1\n    else:\n        a, b = 2, 1  # L(0) and L(1)\n        for _ in range(2, n + 1):\n            a, b = b, a + b\n        return b"}
