{"task_id": "Mbpp/453", "solution": "def sumofFactors(number: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Calculates the sum of even factors for a given number.\n    It identifies all factors, filters the even ones, and sums them.\n    \"\"\"\n\n    def _get_factors(num: int) -> list[int]:\n        \"\"\"Identifies all positive factors of an integer.\"\"\"\n        factors = set()\n        # Iterate from 1 up to the square root of the number.\n        for i in range(1, int(num**0.5) + 1):\n            if num % i == 0:\n                factors.add(i)\n                factors.add(num // i)\n        return sorted(list(factors))\n\n    def _filter_even_factors(factors_list: list[int]) -> list[int]:\n        \"\"\"Filters a list of factors to include only even numbers.\"\"\"\n        return [factor for factor in factors_list if factor % 2 == 0]\n\n    def _sum_factors(even_factors_list: list[int]) -> int:\n        \"\"\"Calculates the sum of a list of numbers.\"\"\"\n        return sum(even_factors_list)\n\n    factors = _get_factors(number)\n    even_factors = _filter_even_factors(factors)\n    total_sum = _sum_factors(even_factors)\n    return total_sum"}
