{"task_id": "Mbpp/457", "solution": "def Find_Min(list_of_lists: list[list[any]]) -> list[any]:\n    \"\"\"\n    Finds the sublist with the minimum length from a list of lists.\n    Returns the first such sublist encountered; returns an empty list if input is empty.\n    \"\"\"\n    if not list_of_lists:\n        return []\n\n    min_length = float('inf')\n    min_sublist = []\n\n    for sublist in list_of_lists:\n        current_sublist_length = len(sublist)\n        if current_sublist_length < min_length:\n            min_length = current_sublist_length\n            min_sublist = sublist\n\n    return min_sublist"}
