{"task_id": "Mbpp/462", "solution": "def combinations_list(elements: list) -> list[list]:\n    \"\"\"Generates all unique combinations (subsets) of the input elements, including the empty list.\n    The order of elements within combinations and the order of combinations themselves match the specified output example.\n    \"\"\"\n    result = [[]]\n\n    for item in elements:\n        # Create new combinations by adding the current item to each existing combination.\n        # Iterate over a copy of 'result' to safely append to 'result' within the loop.\n        for existing_subset in list(result):\n            new_subset = [item] + existing_subset\n            result.append(new_subset)\n            \n    return result"}
