{"task_id": "Mbpp/564", "solution": "def count_Pairs(list_of_integers: list[int]) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Counts the number of possible unordered pairs where both elements are unequal.\n    It iterates through all unique pairs (i, j) with i < j and checks if their values differ.\n    \"\"\"\n    count = 0\n    n = len(list_of_integers)\n    for i in range(n):\n        for j in range(i + 1, n):\n            if list_of_integers[i] != list_of_integers[j]:\n                count += 1\n    return count"}
