{"task_id": "Mbpp/638", "solution": "def wind_chill(wind_velocity_kmh: float, temperature_celsius: float) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Calculates the wind chill index using the standard formula.\n    The result is rounded to the nearest integer.\n    \"\"\"\n    T = temperature_celsius\n    V = wind_velocity_kmh\n\n    # Wind Chill Index (WCI) formula:\n    # WCI = 13.12 + 0.6215 * T - 11.37 * V^0.16 + 0.3965 * T * V^0.16\n    # This formula is typically valid for wind velocities >= 4.8 km/h.\n    # Per instructions, no explicit handling for edge cases like V=0 is included.\n    \n    v_power = V ** 0.16\n    \n    wci = 13.12 + (0.6215 * T) - (11.37 * v_power) + (0.3965 * T * v_power)\n    \n    # Round the calculated WCI to the nearest integer.\n    return round(wci)"}
