{"task_id": "Mbpp/644", "solution": "def reverse_Array_Upto_K(array: list, k: int) -> list:\n    \"\"\"Reverses the order of elements in the input array from the first element\n    up to the element at the specified 1-based position 'k' (inclusive), in-place.\n    \"\"\"\n    start = 0\n    end = k - 1\n\n    while start < end:\n        array[start], array[end] = array[end], array[start]\n        start += 1\n        end -= 1\n\n    return array"}
